{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Prime World: Classic",
    "steam_appid": 3684820,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684820/extras/78a53b3d0248edbafd1d9e6f60620643.avif?t=1752619361\" width=800 height=340 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Prime World Classic Community welcomes you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prime World is a free online RPG/MOBA game with a unique universe, combining tactical session-based battles, castle management, and heroes. We\u2019ve come together to recreate your favorite game in a refreshed form!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose one of two castle designs upon registration;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select and create deadly talent combinations;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple game modes;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make friends;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free access to all previously existing hero skins;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hero rankings;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achieve victories on the battlefields of Praia.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An incredible variety of talents and skins allows everyone to create a unique character tailored to their playstyle! As the server evolves, new castle development and combat features await you.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684820/extras/78a53b3d0248edbafd1d9e6f60620643.avif?t=1752619361\" width=800 height=340 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Prime World Classic Community welcomes you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prime World is a free online RPG/MOBA game with a unique universe, combining tactical session-based battles, castle management, and heroes. We\u2019ve come together to recreate your favorite game in a refreshed form!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose one of two castle designs upon registration;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select and create deadly talent combinations;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple game modes;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make friends;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free access to all previously existing hero skins;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hero rankings;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achieve victories on the battlefields of Praia.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An incredible variety of talents and skins allows everyone to create a unique character tailored to their playstyle! As the server evolves, new castle development and combat features await you.</p>",
    "short_description": "Attention![/b] Prime World Classic is a game created by fans of the original Prime World. The online game combines two genres at once - RPG and MOBA. Control the castle, collect the strongest builds for your heroes and win on the battlefields in the Praya universe!",
